OL,3,GNEWSACambridge scientist missing after
OL,4,ASpanish train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the LMB said it was
OL,7,F"deeply concerned" by reports she had
OL,8,Fbeen on one of the trains, adding: "At
OL,9,Fthis point her whereabouts are
OL,10,Funknown".
